message: "If you use this project, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
type: software
title: "Telecom Customer Churn Prediction & Retention Analytics"
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-20"
authors:
  - family-names: Arain
    given-names: Sana Ur Rehman
    email: sana.arain.work@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/sanaurrehmanarain/telecom-churn-prediction-xgboost"
url: "https://github.com/sanaurrehmanarain/telecom-churn-prediction-xgboost"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A reproducible retrospective proof of concept for telecom customer churn
  prediction. It combines leakage-safe validation, a logistic regression
  baseline, GPU-accelerated XGBoost, risk-ranked and value-aware targeting
  analysis, illustrative campaign break-even scenarios, and a randomized pilot
  design. Results are retrospective and use hypothetical business assumptions;
  no retention experiment was conducted.
keywords:
  - customer churn
  - churn prediction
  - xgboost
  - telecom analytics
  - customer retention
  - binary classification
  - randomized pilot
